<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH SKODA CZK 72.4 MLN Q1 GROSS PROFIT.</title>
<headline>CZECH SKODA CZK 72.4 MLN Q1 GROSS PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for three-month period ending March 31, 1997:</p>
<p>(in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Gross profit		  72.378</p>
<p> Operational profit	 123.613</p>
<p>Revenues from sales of own</p>
<p>  products and services   262.059</p>
<p>Revenues from sales of</p>
<p>  goods			  15.680</p>
<p> Write-offs		    46.389</p>
<p> Basic capital	    9,479.710</p>
<p> Assets		    15,306.649</p>
<p>Note. Comparative results were not immediately available. results are published by the Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, +420-2-2423-0003</p>
<p>(prague.newsroom@reuters.com)</p>
</text>
